Quests of Boom Brothers
    Events
        Player - Player 1 (Red) Selects a unit
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to BoomBrothers
        (Distance between (Position of BoomBrothers) and (Position of Nazgrek)) Less than or equal to 500.00
        (Remaining time for DialogOverTimer) Equal to 0.00
    Actions
        -------- ======== Initial check of the selected unit ======== --------
        Set VariableSet CV = (Custom value of (Triggering unit))
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        UnitIsCasting[CV] Equal to True
                        GCSM_UnitInCombat[CV] Equal to True
                        UnitMoving[CV] Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                -------- ======== Cinematic / dialogue cannot be started because of the conditions ======== --------
                Skip remaining actions
                -------- ======== ======== --------
            Else - Actions
        -------- ======== START ======== --------
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        -------- ======== CINEMATIC STARTS ======== --------
        -------- ======== CINEMATIC MOVE ======== --------
        Set VariableSet CinematicTriggerUnit = Nazgrek
        Set VariableSet CinematicMoveMode = 1
        Set VariableSet CinematicMovePoint[1] = ((Position of BoomBrothers) offset by 256.00 towards 210.00 degrees.)
        Set VariableSet CinematicMovePoint[2] = ((Position of BoomBrothers) offset by 256.00 towards 210.00 degrees.)
        Trigger - Run Cinematic ON <gen> (checking conditions)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_CinematicMovePoint[1])
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_CinematicMovePoint[2])
        -------- Camera --------
        Cinematic - Turn cinematic mode On for (All players)
        Camera - Apply BoomBrothersCam01 <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
        Camera - Pan camera for Player 1 (Red) to (Position of BoomBrothers) over 0.00 seconds
        Wait 1.00 seconds
        Unit - Make BoomBrothers face Nazgrek over 0.75 seconds
        Unit - Make Nazgrek face BoomBrothers over 0.75 seconds
        -------- Nazgrek Greet --------
        Custom script:   call TriggerExecute(gg_trg_Nazgrek_Greet)
        Wait ExSoundDuration seconds
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
            Then - Actions
                -------- NORMAL DIALOG --------
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        BoomBrothersFarewellBoolean Equal to False
                        (QuestBoomWillBeBack is discovered) Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- If the Player has previosly not declined the quest --------
                        -------- ===================================== --------
                        Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Whoa there, big green! You're about to trespass on Boom Brothers Mining & Mayhem™ property!
                        Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0001a", udg_ExSoundString)
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Spro...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                        -------- ===================================== --------
                        Camera - Apply BoomBrothersCam02 <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
                        Wait 1.00 seconds
                        -------- ===================================== --------
                        Set VariableSet ExSoundString = This here mine is ours! Claimed fair and square with sweat, soot, and slightly unstable explosives!
                        Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0002", udg_ExSoundString)
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Fizz...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                        -------- ===================================== --------
                        Set VariableSet ExSoundString = And if you're here to steal our claim, think again — we sleep on the fuse pile!
                        Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0002", udg_ExSoundString)
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Spro...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                        -------- ===================================== --------
                        Camera - Apply BoomBrothersCam03 <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
                        Wait 1.00 seconds
                        -------- ===================================== --------
                        Set VariableSet ExSoundString = I seek no claim, goblins. I’m just looking around.
                        Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Nazgrek_0260", udg_ExSoundString)
                        Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Nazgrek named Nazgrek: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                        -------- ===================================== --------
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        BoomBrothersFarewellBoolean Equal to True
                        And - All (Conditions) are true
                            Conditions
                                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                                    Conditions
                                        (QuestExplosiveCrisis is discovered) Equal to False
                                        (QuestExplosiveCrisis is completed) Equal to True
                                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                                    Conditions
                                        (QuestBoomsiteCompliance is discovered) Equal to False
                                        (QuestBoomsiteCompliance is completed) Equal to True
                                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                                    Conditions
                                        (QuestDustMitigation is discovered) Equal to False
                                        (QuestDustMitigation is completed) Equal to True
                                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                                    Conditions
                                        (QuestMandatoryTraining is discovered) Equal to False
                                        (QuestMandatoryTraining is completed) Equal to True
                        And - All (Conditions) are true
                            Conditions
                                (QuestBoomWillBeBack is discovered) Equal to False
                                (QuestBoomWillBeBack is completed) Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet BoomBrothersRandomGreet = (Random integer number between 1 and 2)
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 1
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Still here? Good. We need all the boom-friendly muscles we can get!
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0006", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Spro...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 2
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = You look like a walking accident — just our type!
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0007", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Fizz...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        BoomBrothersFarewellBoolean Equal to True
                        (QuestBoomWillBeBack is completed) Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet BoomBrothersRandomGreet = (Random integer number between 1 and 4)
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 1
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Everything is back how it should be - thanks to you!
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0096", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Spro...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 2
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Have you found any rare ore vein from the mine yet?
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0099", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Spro...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 3
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = I’m now head of kaboom logistics. Self-promoted.
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0097", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Fizz...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 4
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Hey Nazgrek — want to help dig a hot tub tunnel? No reason…
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0099", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Fizz...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        BoomBrothersFarewellBoolean Equal to True
                        (QuestExplosiveCrisis is discovered) Equal to True
                        (QuestExplosiveCrisis is completed) Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet BoomBrothersRandomGreet = (Random integer number between 1 and 2)
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 1
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Any sign of our barrels? Or did you just come back to look explosive?
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0017", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Fizz...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = It's a work in progress…
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Nazgrek_0030", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Nazgrek named Nazgrek: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 2
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = No pressure, but without those barrels, this mine’s just a damp hole full of dreams and disappointment.
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0018", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Spro...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                                    Conditions
                                        (Charges remaining in (Item carried by Nazgrek of type Barrel of Explosives)) Greater than or equal to 6
                                        (Charges remaining in (Item carried by Zulkis of type Barrel of Explosives)) Greater than or equal to 6
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- Run "Create Dialog" --------
                                Trigger - Run Create BoomBrothersDialog01 <gen> (checking conditions)
                                Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
                                Skip remaining actions
                            Else - Actions
                                -------- ======== CINEMATIC ENDS ======== --------
                                -------- DEFAULT CAMERA --------
                                Camera - Apply BoomBrothersCamSkipped <gen> for Player 1 (Red) over 0.00 seconds
                                -------- ======== CINEMATIC ENDS ======== --------
                                Trigger - Run Cinematic OFF <gen> (checking conditions)
                                Countdown Timer - Start DialogOverTimer as a One-shot timer that will expire in 6.00 seconds
                                -------- ======== ======== --------
                                Trigger - Turn on (This trigger)
                                Skip remaining actions
                    Else - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        BoomBrothersFarewellBoolean Equal to True
                        (QuestBoomWillBeBack is discovered) Equal to True
                        (QuestBoomWillBeBack is completed) Equal to False
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet BoomBrothersRandomGreet = (Random integer number between 1 and 2)
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                BoomBrothersRandomGreet Equal to 1
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                                Set VariableSet ExSoundString = Be careful, his goons have probably rigged the tunnels with turrets and traps!
                                Custom script:   call ExSound_Play("Boomers_0089", udg_ExSoundString)
                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BoomBrothers named Boom Brothers (Spro...: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                            Else - Actions
                                -------- ===================================== --------
